# Purpose
Shows users how to choose quick reactions, action cards, tone controls, and
review actions in the gvturn power footer.

# Key Sections
- Read before clicking.
- Choose quick reactions.
- Choose action cards.
- Use hold-to-edit.
- Interpret review and audit signals.

# Dependencies
- `../concepts/what-is-the-gvturn-power-footer.md`
- `review-ai-work.md`
- `manage-turns-with-gv-menu-eventlog-gvturns.md`

# Gotchas
- Do not tell users to click finalising actions without review.
- Keep behavior generic where product surfaces may vary.

